   - the `lib/dispatch-audit.mjs` row: name `resolveDispatchPackets` and `resolveDispatchCommands` and say `matchDispatchShape` records what the resolver names;
   - the `claude/dispatch-preflight-lint.mjs`, `codex/` and `devin/` row: say each dispatch in a chain is evaluated against its own packet's rules;
   - the `pi/dispatch-preflight-lint.ts` row: say a wrapped or shell-run dispatch is resolved before authorization and every resolved packet's rules are evaluated.
2. `.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/manual-testing-playbook/plugins-and-hooks/cli-dispatch-preflight-authorization.md`:
