3. `.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/manual-testing-playbook/plugins-and-hooks/cli-dispatch-audit-trail.md`, the "Shared core" bullet: say the dispatch is recognized through the same resolver the preflight uses, so a dispatch inside heredoc data is not logged and one inside a heredoc a shell runs is.

